Z||000005||Formula88||09-10-2001||11:25 AM||||You're not getting the link to your pic.  This happens sometimes.  Open PIP, click on History, then click on the pic you want to post.  You'll notice the path shows up in the "Clipboard Contents:" window.  Copy that text into your message and you should be set.  Notice, <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip" TARGET=_blank>www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip</A>  is a link to PIP, not the actual pic you're trying to post.  ||||reg||1
